    .idml: returns [] (no thumbnail).
    .indd: scans the first 8 MiB for the JFIF SOI marker, finds the
    end-of-image marker, writes the bytes as a JPEG candidate.
    Returns [] when no preview is found OR when the path doesn't exist.
    """
